<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 451)</h2>
<p><b>No holes, no missing media.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Proxy fallback for session seats</b>: a seat that joins a shared review without a clip on disk now streams the same encrypted proxy the web browser gets — the shot just appears and plays, notes and marks file under the real clip name, and an orange <b>PROXY</b> badge sits in the HUD the whole time so a streamed preview is never mistaken for the delivery. Needs the session to have a web share; without one, missing media reports as before.</li>
<li>Streamed proxies cache per session, so a clip fetches once and replays instantly.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
